@startuml
actor Member
participant "Payment / balance use case" as UC
participant "Authorization" as Auth
database "Transactional store\n(product not selected)" as Store
participant "Journal" as Journal

Member -> UC : request pairwise balance
UC -> Auth : check current group membership
Auth --> UC : authorized
UC -> Journal : query net pairwise entries
Journal --> UC : derived balance
UC --> Member : debtor / creditor / amount

Member -> UC : record partial or full payment
UC -> Auth : authorize payer and payee
Auth --> UC : authorized
UC -> Store : begin; re-read current debt
alt amount exceeds outstanding debt
  Store --> UC : reject; no writes
  UC --> Member : overpayment validation error
else valid payment
  Store -> Journal : append immutable payment offset\nand payment record atomically
  Journal --> Store : committed once
  Store --> UC : updated balance
  UC --> Member : payment ID and new balance
end

Member -> UC : request correction (owner/manager only)
UC -> Auth : check role and correction policy
Auth --> UC : authorized
UC -> Store : save pending correction; original unchanged
note over Store,Journal
Only approved correction appends a compensating entry.
Payment reversal is bounded by unreversed original amount.
end note
@enduml
